subsectors),\\n    BasisSectors[b2] \[LongDash] basis sectors (at least one \
immediate subsector is zero),\\n    ZerojRule[b2] \[LongDash] a rule to \
nullify all zero j[b2\[Ellipsis]],\\n    CutDs[b2] \[LongDash] a flag list of \
